## Source Availability

Irminsul is proprietary software.

The source code is intentionally not published because the project contains
anti-abuse, moderation, and detection logic that could become less effective
if publicly disclosed.

To promote transparency while protecting the integrity of the project,
source code access may be granted upon request to:

- Approved contributors
- Server administrators evaluating or deploying Irminsul
- Security researchers performing responsible security reviews

Access requests are reviewed individually and granted at the sole discretion
of the copyright holder.

Access to the source code is provided for inspection, auditing, security
research, or contribution purposes only. It does not grant permission to
redistribute, publish, create derivative works, or use the code in other
projects unless explicitly authorized in writing.
